# Parallel — environment variable reference
#
# This file is documentation only — actual env files live per-app and are git-ignored:
#   apps/api/.env        (copy from apps/api/.env.example)
#   apps/web/.env.local   (copy from apps/web/.env.example)
#
# Listed here so the full picture is in one place. See PARALLEL_master_blueprint_final.md
# §10 for what each service is for.

# ── apps/api ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NODE_ENV, PORT, CORS_ORIGIN
# DATABASE_URL          — Postgres (pgvector), from infra/docker-compose.yml locally
# REDIS_URL             — Redis, from infra/docker-compose.yml locally
# JWT_SECRET, JWT_EXPIRES_IN
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY      — identity descriptions, Quest generation, Wrapped copy (Phase 6/9)
# EMBEDDING_API_KEY      — interest/content embeddings (Phase 6)
# OBJECT_STORAGE_*, CDN_BASE_URL — Identity Card / Wrapped asset rendering (Phase 9)

# ── apps/web ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL    — browser-facing API base URL
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL     — browser-facing WebSocket base URL
# API_INTERNAL_URL       — server-only, used by Route Handlers (OG images, webhooks)
